+ accent is recommended for content also. contest. 1. Pronounce the noun kd’ntést, the verb konté’st; see Noun & VERB ACCENT.
===
+ accent is recommended for *content* also.

**contest.** **1.** Pronounce the noun kŏ'ntĕst, the verb kontĕ'st; see ^^NOUN & VERB ACCENT^^.
